{"id":"question.physiology.respiratory.alveolar-equation-deadspace.001","kind":"original_concept_question","lessonId":"physiology.respiratory.alveolar-equation-deadspace","media":{"items":[{"columns":[{"id":"c0","label":"양식"},{"id":"c1","label":"VT(L)"},{"id":"c2","label":"f(/min)"},{"id":"c3","label":"VD(L)"}],"id":"question.physiology.respiratory.alveolar-equation-deadspace.001.media.question-table","rows":[{"cells":["A",0.5,12,0.15],"id":"r0"},{"cells":["B",0.3,20,0.15],"id":"r1"}],"stage":"question","title":"제시 조건","type":"table"}],"schemaVersion":"1.0.0"},"options":[{"id":"A","text":"1.8L/분, 3.0L/분"},{"id":"B","text":"3.0L/분, 4.2L/분"},{"id":"C","text":"4.2L/분, 3.0L/분"},{"id":"D","text":"4.2L/분, 6.0L/분"},{"id":"E","text":"6.0L/분, 6.0L/분"}],"prompt":"호흡 양식 A와 B의 일회호흡량 및 호흡수는 표와 같다. 매 호흡의 사강량을 0.15L로 고정하고 폐포환기량을 (VT−VD)×f로 계산할 때, A와 B의 값을 순서대로 연결한 것은?","verificationStatus":"editorial_draft_not_exam_validated"}